# ─── DDR Report Generator — Environment Variables ─────────────────
# All API keys are OPTIONAL and commented out by default.
# This app uses ONLY client-supplied keys (X-API-Key header).
# Uncomment a key below ONLY if you want a server-side fallback
# for development/testing (not recommended for production).

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# Output directory for generated .docx files (default: /output)
# OUTPUT_DIR=/output
